{'symbol': 'GEHC', 'date': '2023-04-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'GE HEALTHCARE ANNOUNCES AVAILABILITY OF NEXT-GENERATION BKACTIV FOR GUIDING UROLOGY, COLORECTAL AND PELVIC FLOOR SURGERIES', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GE HEALTHCARE (NASDAQ: GEHC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE NEXT-GENERATION BKACTIV IS NOW AVAILABLE FOR GUIDING UROLOGY, COLORECTAL AND PELVIC FLOOR SURGICAL PROCEDURES. THE FLAGSHIP INTRAOPERATIVE ULTRASOUND IMAGING SYSTEM, DEVELOPED BY BK MEDICAL - A SUBSIDIARY OF GE HEALTHCARE, WAS DESIGNED TO DELIVER HIGH-PERFORMANCE ULTRASOUND GUIDANCE WITH A SIMPLIFIED, INTUITIVE USER EXPERIENCE FOR SURGEONS. THE BKACTIV'S AUTOMATIC NO-TOUCH AUTOGAIN AND ADVANCED ALGORITHMS PROVIDE UNMATCH."}